    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「けっこう筋肉あるよね、触っていい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「あっ、ごめん。触るのは駄目だよね……。よく言われるんだよね、無神経だって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「あたし、どうしてこう『がさつ』なのかな〜。三波ちゃんや、ゆきちゃんみたいにお淑やかになりたいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「えっ、触っていいって？　いやあの、べつにそこまで筋肉に興味があるわけじゃないけどねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「あんた、お人好しだよね〜。今日もえっと、お姉さんの仕事を手伝ってたんだっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「お姉さんって、何してるひとなん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「よく知らないんだ、ふぅん……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「うちは姉妹だからわかんないけど、お姉ちゃんと弟ってあんまり会話しない感じ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「まぁ、転校生は誰に対しても無口だけどさ。つうか、あたしが喋りすぎ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「うるさくてごめん、嫌なら嫌って言ってね？　あたし、そういうの無頓着だからさ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「しかしまぁ、ちょうどいいところに通りがかってくれたよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「うちのさ、バカ親父が誕生日なんだよ。ご機嫌取りに、何か買ってこうかな〜って♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「つっても。男がもらって嬉しいものって、いまいちピンとこなくてさ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「よく読む雑誌でプレゼント特集とかあるけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「たぶんそこで想定されてるのって父親へのプレゼントじゃないもんね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「バイト先のおっさんとかにも聞いてみたんだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「『かわいい娘になら何をもらっても嬉しい』みたいな感じでさ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「そりゃそうかもしれないけど、そういうことじゃないわけ。わかる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「つってもバカ親父とは普段は口もきかないから、趣味とか好みとかわかんないしさ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「藁にも縋る気持ちで、あんたに声をかけたんだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 47,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まい",
    "text": "「そのへんの店、一緒に見て回ってもらっていい？　デートしようぜ、デート♪」"
